    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1113">

                <pb facs="1139" n="1125" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg1125"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/1212: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in El Salvador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-10T18:00:00-04:00">June 10, 1944—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>159. You may, in your discretion, inform the appropriate Salvadoran authority
                    that the Department does not support the views expressed by Mr. Renwick,
                    regarding the recent Salvadoran bond settlement, as set forth in the enclosure
                    to your despatch no. 1599 of May 20, 1944.<anchor n="98" xml:id="d1113-f1"/> The
                    Department has no objection to the plan already negotiated between the
                    Salvadoran representatives and the Foreign Bondholders Council; and it earnestly
                    hopes that the Salvadoran Government, on its part, will maintain the expressed
                    intention of the previous Salvadoran Administration<anchor n="99"
                        xml:id="d1113-f2"/> to carry out this plan. Further <pb facs="1140" n="1126"
                        xml:id="pg1126"/> background material is being forwarded by airmail for your
                    information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1113-f1" n="98" xml:id="d1113-f1-content">
                <p>Despatch and its enclosures not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1113-f2" n="99" xml:id="d1113-f2-content">
                <p>For information on the revolutionary change of government in El Salvador, see
                        <ref target="#pg1087">pp. 1087</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
